{"seq":3,"slug":"caching-and-incremental-builds","title":"缓存与增量构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/pipeline-and-devops/caching-and-incremental-builds","wordCount":1043,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"缓存与增量构建\">缓存与增量构建</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>缓存与增量构建基于同一条朴素假设：输入不变，输出就不该重新计算。落地时它被拆成两个要素——以输入（源文件、配置、依赖版本）计算出的哈希作为缓存键，以及一份可复用的产物存放处。缓存可作用在多个层面：打包器的持久化缓存、TypeScript 的增量编译、任务编排器的任务级缓存、CI 的远程缓存。真正难的不是「怎么存」，而是「什么时候该失效」——键的设计与失效策略决定了缓存是加速还是产出错误结果。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"构建缓存的核心原理\">构建缓存的核心原理</h2><p>构建缓存的基本思路非常简单：如果输入没有变化，那么输出也不应该变化。通过记录每次构建的输入（源文件、配置、依赖版本）和输出（产物文件），下次遇到相同的输入时直接复用之前的输出，跳过实际的构建过程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    INPUT[构建输入&lt;br/&gt;源文件 + 配置 + 依赖]&#10;    HASH[计算输入哈希]&#10;    CACHE_CHECK{缓存命中?}&#10;    BUILD[执行构建]&#10;    STORE[存入缓存]&#10;    RESTORE[从缓存恢复]&#10;    OUTPUT[构建产物]&#10;&#10;    INPUT --&gt; HASH --&gt; CACHE_CHECK&#10;    CACHE_CHECK --&gt;|否| BUILD --&gt; STORE --&gt; OUTPUT&#10;    CACHE_CHECK --&gt;|是| RESTORE --&gt; OUTPUT\">flowchart TD\n    INPUT[构建输入&lt;br/&gt;源文件 + 配置 + 依赖]\n    HASH[计算输入哈希]\n    CACHE_CHECK{缓存命中?}\n    BUILD[执行构建]\n    STORE[存入缓存]\n    RESTORE[从缓存恢复]\n    OUTPUT[构建产物]\n\n    INPUT --&gt; HASH --&gt; CACHE_CHECK\n    CACHE_CHECK --&gt;|否| BUILD --&gt; STORE --&gt; OUTPUT\n    CACHE_CHECK --&gt;|是| RESTORE --&gt; OUTPUT</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"打包器层面的缓存\">打包器层面的缓存</h2><h3 id=\"webpack-rspack-持久化缓存\">Webpack/Rspack 持久化缓存</h3><p>Webpack 5 引入了持久化缓存（Persistent Cache），将编译结果写入磁盘，二次构建速度大幅提升：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// webpack.config.js&#10;export default {&#10;  cache: {&#10;    type: &#39;filesystem&#39;,&#10;    buildDependencies: {&#10;      config: [__filename],&#10;    },&#10;    cacheDirectory: &#39;.cache/webpack&#39;,&#10;    name: `${process.env.NODE_ENV}-${process.env.TARGET}`,&#10;    version: &#39;1.0&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// webpack.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cache: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'filesystem'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    buildDependencies: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      config: [__filename],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cacheDirectory: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.cache/webpack'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">process</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NODE_ENV</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}-${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">process</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TARGET</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    version: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// rsbuild.config.ts - Rspack 缓存配置&#10;export default {&#10;  performance: {&#10;    buildCache: {&#10;      type: &#39;filesystem&#39;,&#10;      cacheDirectory: &#39;.cache/rspack&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// rsbuild.config.ts - Rspack 缓存配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  performance: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    buildCache: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'filesystem'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      cacheDirectory: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.cache/rspack'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓存类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>构建间持久</th>\n<th>速度提升</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>memory</td>\n<td>内存缓存，进程结束即丢失</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>2-3x (watch)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>filesystem</td>\n<td>磁盘缓存，跨构建持久化</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>5-10x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"vite-的依赖预构建缓存\">Vite 的依赖预构建缓存</h3><p>Vite 将预构建结果缓存在 <code>node_modules/.vite/</code> 目录：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// vite.config.ts&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  cacheDir: &#39;node_modules/.vite&#39;,&#10;  optimizeDeps: {&#10;    force: false,&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// vite.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cacheDir: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'node_modules/.vite'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  optimizeDeps: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    force: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Vite 的缓存在以下情况自动失效：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>package.json</code> 中的依赖版本变更</li>\n<li>锁文件（pnpm-lock.yaml）变更</li>\n<li><code>vite.config.ts</code> 中的相关配置变更</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"typescript-增量编译\">TypeScript 增量编译</h2><p>TypeScript 编译器支持增量编译（Incremental Compilation），通过记录上次编译的状态信息来加速后续编译：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;incremental&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;tsBuildInfoFile&quot;: &quot;.cache/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"incremental\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tsBuildInfoFile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".cache/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"项目引用的增量构建\">项目引用的增量构建</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 增量构建所有项目&#10;tsc --build --incremental&#10;&#10;# 强制全量构建&#10;tsc --build --force&#10;&#10;# 清除增量缓存&#10;tsc --build --clean\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 增量构建所有项目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tsc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --incremental</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 强制全量构建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tsc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --force</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 清除增量缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tsc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --clean</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 首次构建&#10;        F_UTILS[编译 utils&lt;br/&gt;3s] --&gt; F_UI[编译 ui&lt;br/&gt;5s] --&gt; F_APP[编译 app&lt;br/&gt;8s]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 增量构建 - 只修改了 utils&#10;        I_UTILS[重编译 utils&lt;br/&gt;0.5s] --&gt; I_UI[重编译 ui&lt;br/&gt;1s] --&gt; I_APP[重编译 app&lt;br/&gt;2s]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 首次构建\n        F_UTILS[编译 utils&lt;br/&gt;3s] --&gt; F_UI[编译 ui&lt;br/&gt;5s] --&gt; F_APP[编译 app&lt;br/&gt;8s]\n    end\n    subgraph 增量构建 - 只修改了 utils\n        I_UTILS[重编译 utils&lt;br/&gt;0.5s] --&gt; I_UI[重编译 ui&lt;br/&gt;1s] --&gt; I_APP[重编译 app&lt;br/&gt;2s]\n    end</pre><p>tsc 的增量编译通过 <code>.tsbuildinfo</code> 文件记录：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个文件的内容哈希</li>\n<li>文件间的依赖关系</li>\n<li>上次编译的配置</li>\n</ul>\n<p>当只有少数文件变更时，tsc 只需要重新编译变更的文件及其依赖链上的文件。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"任务编排层面的缓存\">任务编排层面的缓存</h2><h3 id=\"turborepo-本地缓存\">Turborepo 本地缓存</h3><p>Turborepo 在任务级别实现了缓存。它根据任务的输入（源文件、环境变量、依赖版本）计算哈希，如果哈希匹配则直接从缓存中恢复输出：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"$ turbo build&#10;&#10; Tasks:    5 successful, 5 total&#10; Cached:   4 cached, 5 total&#10; Time:     1.2s&#10;&#10; @myorg/config#build     cache hit ✅   replaying logs  120ms&#10; @myorg/utils#build      cache hit ✅   replaying logs  180ms&#10; @myorg/ui#build          cache hit ✅   replaying logs  350ms&#10; @myorg/admin#build      cache hit ✅   replaying logs  800ms&#10; @myorg/web#build         cache miss     executed        1.1s\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>$ turbo build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Tasks:    5 successful, 5 total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Cached:   4 cached, 5 total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Time:     1.2s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @myorg/config#build     cache hit ✅   replaying logs  120ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @myorg/utils#build      cache hit ✅   replaying logs  180ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @myorg/ui#build          cache hit ✅   replaying logs  350ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @myorg/admin#build      cache hit ✅   replaying logs  800ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @myorg/web#build         cache miss     executed        1.1s</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"turborepo-远程缓存\">Turborepo 远程缓存</h3><p>远程缓存允许团队成员之间共享构建缓存。当 CI 完成构建后，其他开发者和后续的 CI 运行可以直接复用这些缓存：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    DEV_A[开发者 A&lt;br/&gt;首次构建]&#10;    REMOTE[远程缓存&lt;br/&gt;Vercel Remote Cache]&#10;    DEV_B[开发者 B&lt;br/&gt;缓存命中]&#10;    CI[CI 流水线&lt;br/&gt;缓存命中]&#10;&#10;    DEV_A --&gt;|上传缓存| REMOTE&#10;    REMOTE --&gt;|下载缓存| DEV_B&#10;    REMOTE --&gt;|下载缓存| CI\">flowchart TD\n    DEV_A[开发者 A&lt;br/&gt;首次构建]\n    REMOTE[远程缓存&lt;br/&gt;Vercel Remote Cache]\n    DEV_B[开发者 B&lt;br/&gt;缓存命中]\n    CI[CI 流水线&lt;br/&gt;缓存命中]\n\n    DEV_A --&gt;|上传缓存| REMOTE\n    REMOTE --&gt;|下载缓存| DEV_B\n    REMOTE --&gt;|下载缓存| CI</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 登录远程缓存&#10;npx turbo login&#10;&#10;# 链接到团队&#10;npx turbo link&#10;&#10;# 构建时自动使用远程缓存&#10;turbo build\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 登录远程缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 链接到团队</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> link</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建时自动使用远程缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自托管远程缓存\">自托管远程缓存</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# docker-compose.yml - 自托管 Turborepo 缓存服务器&#10;services:&#10;  turbo-cache:&#10;    image: ducktors/turborepo-remote-cache&#10;    ports:&#10;      - &#39;3000:3000&#39;&#10;    environment:&#10;      STORAGE_PROVIDER: s3&#10;      S3_ACCESS_KEY: ${AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID}&#10;      S3_SECRET_KEY: ${AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY}&#10;      S3_BUCKET: turbo-cache&#10;      S3_REGION: us-east-1&#10;      TURBO_TOKEN: ${TURBO_TOKEN}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># docker-compose.yml - 自托管 Turborepo 缓存服务器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  turbo-cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ducktors/turborepo-remote-cache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3000:3000'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      STORAGE_PROVIDER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">s3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      S3_ACCESS_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      S3_SECRET_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      S3_BUCKET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">turbo-cache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      S3_REGION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">us-east-1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      TURBO_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${TURBO_TOKEN}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"ci-中的缓存策略\">CI 中的缓存策略</h2><h3 id=\"多层缓存架构\">多层缓存架构</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 缓存层级&#10;        L1[L1: 依赖缓存&lt;br/&gt;pnpm store]&#10;        L2[L2: 打包器缓存&lt;br/&gt;Webpack/Rspack 持久化缓存]&#10;        L3[L3: 任务缓存&lt;br/&gt;Turborepo 远程缓存]&#10;        L4[L4: 产物缓存&lt;br/&gt;Docker 层缓存]&#10;    end&#10;    L1 --&gt; L2 --&gt; L3 --&gt; L4\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 缓存层级\n        L1[L1: 依赖缓存&lt;br/&gt;pnpm store]\n        L2[L2: 打包器缓存&lt;br/&gt;Webpack/Rspack 持久化缓存]\n        L3[L3: 任务缓存&lt;br/&gt;Turborepo 远程缓存]\n        L4[L4: 产物缓存&lt;br/&gt;Docker 层缓存]\n    end\n    L1 --&gt; L2 --&gt; L3 --&gt; L4</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/ci.yml - 多层缓存&#10;jobs:&#10;  build:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 22&#10;          cache: pnpm&#10;&#10;      # L2: 打包器缓存&#10;      - uses: actions/cache@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          path: |&#10;            .cache/rspack&#10;            node_modules/.vite&#10;          key: build-cache-${{ hashFiles(&#39;pnpm-lock.yaml&#39;) }}-${{ github.sha }}&#10;          restore-keys: |&#10;            build-cache-${{ hashFiles(&#39;pnpm-lock.yaml&#39;) }}-&#10;            build-cache-&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;&#10;      # L3: Turborepo 远程缓存&#10;      - run: turbo build&#10;        env:&#10;          TURBO_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.TURBO_TOKEN }}&#10;          TURBO_TEAM: ${{ vars.TURBO_TEAM }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/ci.yml - 多层缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">22</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # L2: 打包器缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/cache@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            .cache/rspack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            node_modules/.vite</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">build-cache-${{ hashFiles('pnpm-lock.yaml') }}-${{ github.sha }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          restore-keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            build-cache-${{ hashFiles('pnpm-lock.yaml') }}-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            build-cache-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # L3: Turborepo 远程缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">turbo build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          TURBO_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.TURBO_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          TURBO_TEAM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ vars.TURBO_TEAM }}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"缓存失效策略\">缓存失效策略</h2><p>缓存虽然能大幅提升构建速度，但错误的缓存可能导致构建结果不正确。理解缓存失效时机至关重要：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>应失效的缓存</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>源文件变更</td>\n<td>受影响的编译缓存 + 任务缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖版本变更</td>\n<td>所有缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建配置变更</td>\n<td>打包器缓存 + 任务缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node.js 版本变更</td>\n<td>所有缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境变量变更</td>\n<td>使用该变量的任务缓存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 清除 Turborepo 缓存&#10;turbo clean&#10;&#10;# 清除 Vite 预构建缓存&#10;rm -rf node_modules/.vite&#10;&#10;# 清除 Webpack/Rspack 缓存&#10;rm -rf .cache/webpack&#10;rm -rf .cache/rspack&#10;&#10;# 强制全量构建&#10;turbo build --force\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 清除 Turborepo 缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 清除 Vite 预构建缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -rf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node_modules/.vite</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 清除 Webpack/Rspack 缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -rf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .cache/webpack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -rf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .cache/rspack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 强制全量构建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --force</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"构建性能监控\">构建性能监控</h2><h3 id=\"构建时间追踪\">构建时间追踪</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// webpack.config.js&#10;import SpeedMeasurePlugin from &#39;speed-measure-webpack-plugin&#39;;&#10;&#10;const smp = new SpeedMeasurePlugin({&#10;  outputFormat: &#39;humanVerbose&#39;,&#10;  loaderTopFiles: 10,&#10;});&#10;&#10;export default smp.wrap({&#10;  // webpack config&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// webpack.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SpeedMeasurePlugin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'speed-measure-webpack-plugin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> smp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SpeedMeasurePlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  outputFormat: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'humanVerbose'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  loaderTopFiles: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> smp.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wrap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // webpack config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"构建指标看板\">构建指标看板</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>健康阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>冷构建时间</td>\n<td>无缓存的完整构建耗时</td>\n<td>&lt; 60s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热构建时间</td>\n<td>有缓存的增量构建耗时</td>\n<td>&lt; 10s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存命中率</td>\n<td>缓存命中的任务占比</td>\n<td>&gt; 80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI 流水线总时长</td>\n<td>从推送到部署完成的时间</td>\n<td>&lt; 10min</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖安装时间</td>\n<td>pnpm install 耗时</td>\n<td>&lt; 30s（有缓存）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>构建缓存的核心原理：相同的输入产生相同的输出，跳过重复计算。</li>\n<li>打包器缓存（Webpack/Rspack filesystem cache）可将二次构建提速 5-10 倍。</li>\n<li>TypeScript 增量编译通过 <code>.tsbuildinfo</code> 文件记录编译状态。</li>\n<li>Turborepo 远程缓存实现了团队级别的构建缓存共享。</li>\n<li>CI 中应采用多层缓存策略：依赖缓存 → 打包器缓存 → 任务缓存。</li>\n<li>缓存失效策略同样重要——错误的缓存比没有缓存更危险。</li>\n<li>定期监控构建指标，确保构建性能持续健康。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缓存与增量构建","id":"缓存与增量构建"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"构建缓存的核心原理","id":"构建缓存的核心原理"},{"level":2,"text":"打包器层面的缓存","id":"打包器层面的缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"Webpack/Rspack 持久化缓存","id":"webpack-rspack-持久化缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"Vite 的依赖预构建缓存","id":"vite-的依赖预构建缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"TypeScript 增量编译","id":"typescript-增量编译"},{"level":3,"text":"项目引用的增量构建","id":"项目引用的增量构建"},{"level":2,"text":"任务编排层面的缓存","id":"任务编排层面的缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"Turborepo 本地缓存","id":"turborepo-本地缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"Turborepo 远程缓存","id":"turborepo-远程缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"自托管远程缓存","id":"自托管远程缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"CI 中的缓存策略","id":"ci-中的缓存策略"},{"level":3,"text":"多层缓存架构","id":"多层缓存架构"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存失效策略","id":"缓存失效策略"},{"level":2,"text":"构建性能监控","id":"构建性能监控"},{"level":3,"text":"构建时间追踪","id":"构建时间追踪"},{"level":3,"text":"构建指标看板","id":"构建指标看板"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Monorepo 构建策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/pipeline-and-devops/monorepo-build-strategies"},"next":null}